error[build]: `chosen.link = ...` writes one of several records, an `if`'s arms or a list's elements, and would fill one hole and leave the rest open: a hole is filled by the name of the record built with it (module build_write_a_field_an_if_may_have_overwritten)
error[build]: `held.link = ...` writes only block-born values: `held` is not a construction made in this `build` block, so it stays immutable (module build_write_a_field_an_if_may_have_overwritten)
